#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:5
#: fddd7a4851fd4957bd1bff33e92aef40
msgid "Proximity Sensors (landing page)"
msgstr "近距传感器（登录页）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:7
#: b14939ae52154cf4945d0533d7193b12
msgid ""
"Copter/Rover have support for avoidance obstacles that may appear in front "
"of the vehicle. The first step to enable these features is to have a working"
" Proximity Sensor. ArduPilot supports up to 4 sensors."
msgstr ""
"Copter/Rover 支持避开飞行器前方出现的障碍物。启用这些功能的第一步是配置可用的近距传感器。ArduPilot 最多支持 4 个传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:9
#: d24ec533f43141a185260a16c45fcf44
msgid ""
"360 degree Lidars are typically used in object avoidance as proximity "
"sensors, but multiple rangefinders sensors or stereo depth cameras can also "
"be used for proximity detection."
msgstr "360 度激光雷达通常用作近距传感器进行避障，但多个测距仪传感器或立体深度摄像头也可用于近距检测。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:13
#: 21b925d1411142a6aab06e0dfb7b2e9c
msgid ""
"Users often confuse RangeFinders with proximity sensors. Rangefinders are "
"typically single dimensional sensors, that provide distances from a very "
"narrow ray. Proximity Sensors is generally a name used for 360 Lidar and "
"other sensors with a wider FOV. The settings and parameters used for both "
"classes of sensors are different."
msgstr ""
"用户常将测距仪（RangeFinder）与近距传感器（Proximity "
"Sensor）混淆。测距仪通常是单维度传感器，通过极窄光束提供距离。近距传感器一般指 360 "
"度激光雷达和其他视角更宽的传感器。两类传感器的设置和参数有所不同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:16
#: a76721d8183043789b2ef14e465d11c4
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:18
#: 9255058e5ee3465bad74cc3fe2381012
msgid ""
"You will need to set up the parameter ``PRXx_TYPE`` correctly for the "
"sensor(s) you are using. Exclusion zones are provided for 360 degree Lidars,"
" since these may have obstructions in their field of view. Exclusion zones "
"are set via the ``PRXx_IGN_ANGx`` and ``PRXx_IGN_WIDx`` parameters, "
"specifying a direction and width the frame obstruction presents and will be "
"ignored. Up to 6 exclusion sectors can be specified."
msgstr ""
"您需要为所使用的传感器正确设置 ``PRXx_TYPE`` 参数。360 度激光雷达支持排除区域，因为其视场内可能有遮挡物。排除区域通过 "
"``PRXx_IGN_ANGx`` 和 ``PRXx_IGN_WIDx`` 参数设置，指定机架遮挡物的方向和宽度以将其忽略。最多可指定 6 个排除扇区。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:21
#: daa1b80739604b3391b0f617c27f7180
msgid ""
"A list of supported units is shown on the :ref:`common-rangefinder-"
"landingpage` under \"Omnidirectional Proximity Rangefinders\""
msgstr "支持设备列表见 :ref:`common-rangefinder-landingpage` 中的「全向近距测距仪」部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:24
#: 51fe2d0bd34f47c9a3e56e56e2f8243e
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:27
#: edd2f5c8bbb44279accbc59f84bae34e
msgid "Real-time view"
msgstr "实时视图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:29
#: 2da522dde9f040bfa65fa12846ab6d40
msgid ""
"Real-time distances can be seen in the Mission Planner's proximity viewer"
msgstr "可在 Mission Planner 的近距传感器查看器中查看实时距离"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:37
#: 12fb531e34f24511bd1a323f61deb06d
msgid ""
"Press the plus and minus key while the proximity window is open to change "
"the range of the display."
msgstr "在近距传感器窗口打开时，按加号和减号键可更改显示范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:41
#: 099da46669874177af970cc4825ad53b
msgid ""
"This window can be opened by moving to the MP's Flight Data screen, press "
"Ctrl-F and push the Proximity button."
msgstr "此窗口可通过进入 MP 的飞行数据界面、按 Ctrl-F 后点击「Proximity」按钮打开。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:48
#: e9a3abb596234135be14009266cbe865
msgid "DataFlash logging"
msgstr "DataFlash 日志记录"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:50
#: acd6658acc564dee8bad242e263c691c
msgid ""
"Upward and downward facing range finder distances can be seen in the "
"DataFlash Log's RFND message."
msgstr "向上和向下测距仪的距离可在 DataFlash 日志的 RFND 消息中查看。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:52
#: a3a56a328fad43659681666d0953f18e
msgid ""
"The distance to the nearest object in 8 quadrants around the vehicle is "
"recorded in the DataFlash log's PRX messages. Since Copter and Rover have "
"the ability to store 3D obstacles, various instances of PRX message log is "
"used. 0th instance stands for obstacles detected between -75 to -45 degrees "
"pitch. Similarly, PRX[1] stores from -45 to -15 degrees, and PRX[2] stores "
"from -15 to + 15 degrees and so on."
msgstr ""
"飞行器周围 8 个象限中最近障碍物的距离记录在 DataFlash 日志的 PRX 消息中。由于 Copter 和 Rover "
"能够存储三维障碍物信息，会使用 PRX 消息的多个实例。第 0 个实例记录俯仰角 -75 至 -45 度之间检测到的障碍物，PRX[1] 记录 -45 "
"至 -15 度，PRX[2] 记录 -15 至 +15 度，以此类推。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:56
#: 2827216b6d654da1a8f12353781f9844
msgid "Additional Features"
msgstr "附加功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:59
#: 12069d8fca204c138527d961a52f86a2
msgid "Filter"
msgstr "滤波器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:61
#: 1175a5ee5d4f4ff88732d298182d00b3
msgid ""
"Various sensors can be attached to the autopilot. However, depending on the "
"quality and use case of the sensor, it might give noisy data. This noise "
"will be stored onboard the autopilot as \"obstacles\" and the vehicle might "
"suddenly start avoiding false objects. To counter this problem, Copter and "
"Rover have an inbuilt low pass filter on the raw sensor data. The filter can"
" be adjusted by :ref:`PRX_FILT <PRX_FILT>` (setting it to 0 will disable the"
" feature). By default, only the filtered values get logged. However, by "
"setting :ref:`PRX_LOG_RAW <PRX_LOG_RAW>` = 1, raw values from the sensors "
"will also be logged. This can be used for debugging purposes."
msgstr ""
"各种传感器均可接入飞控。但根据传感器质量和使用场景，其数据可能存在噪声。这些噪声会以「障碍物」的形式存储到飞控中，导致飞行器突然开始规避虚假目标。为解决此问题，Copter"
" 和 Rover 内置了对原始传感器数据的低通滤波器。可通过 :ref:`PRX_FILT <PRX_FILT>` 调整滤波器（设为 0 "
"将禁用该功能）。默认情况下，只记录滤波后的数值。但将 :ref:`PRX_LOG_RAW <PRX_LOG_RAW>` 设为 1 "
"后，也会记录传感器原始数值，可用于调试。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:67
#: b219e9b75d65469d9747fbfd1c2cec2b
msgid "Ground detection"
msgstr "地面检测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:71
#: 07b7cb51695542b2b9c2121839e1777b
msgid ""
"This feature requires a valid downward facing rangefinder configured first "
"and only works with Copter."
msgstr "此功能需要先配置一个有效的向下测距仪，且仅适用于 Copter。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:73
#: 0d3e67e5c8fb41e2a614005538a8b886
msgid ""
"For low altitude obstacle avoidance, and while just taking off and landing, "
"sometimes the sensor will pick up the ground below as obstacle. This can be "
"dangerous because the vehicle will try and \"avoid\" these obstacles (if "
"avoidance features are turned on). By setting :ref:`PRX_IGN_GND "
"<PRX_IGN_GND>` = 1, we attempt to detect and ignore any obstacles that are "
"near the ground."
msgstr ""
"在低空避障以及起飞和降落过程中，传感器有时会将正下方的地面误识别为障碍物。如果开启了避障功能，飞行器可能会试图「规避」这些障碍物，存在危险。通过将 "
":ref:`PRX_IGN_GND <PRX_IGN_GND>` 设为 1，系统将尝试检测并忽略地面附近的障碍物。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-proximity-landingpage.rst:78
#: 22e5ec0d958c4583ae68827f43e48b9f
msgid ""
"This feature only works when the vehicle is armed It might also ignore valid"
" obstacles when the vehicle is flying very close to the ground. Detected "
"obstacles will not be visible on the Mission Planner Proximity Viewer, or "
"data flash logs."
msgstr ""
"此功能仅在飞行器解锁后有效。当飞行器非常贴近地面飞行时，也可能忽略真实障碍物。被检测到的障碍物不会显示在 Mission Planner "
"的近距传感器查看器或 DataFlash 日志中。"
